<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>House Inventory System - User Guide</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>How to Add an Item</h1>
    <p>This section walks users through adding a new item to the house inventory.</p>

    <h2>Steps to Add an Item</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Launch the application</li>
        <li>
            Find the 'Add Item' button on the main page, and the Add Item window will open.
            <img src="/add_item1.png"
                 alt="Add Item window"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>
            Enter the item's name, quantity, and details.
            <img src="/add_item2.png"
                 alt="Add item information"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>Select the location from the list previously created.</li>
        <li>Click the 'Add Item' button to save new item.</li>
        <li>
            The Add Item window will close and the new item will be displayed on the main page in the inventory table.
            <img src="/add_item3.png"
                 alt="Item information displayed on inventory table"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>